        "image": [],
        "question": [
            "What does the argument -report_file_name do in the detailed_placement command?"
        ],
        "question_type": [
            "open"
        ],
        "answer": [
            "The -report_file_name argument for the detailed_placement command specifies where the report for detailed placement should be saved. The report is saved in the JSON format and contains metrics related to detailed_placement. If this argument is not provided, no report will be saved for the detailed_placement command."
        ],
